    "issue_key": "MER-115",
    "summary": "Invoice preview cancellation leaves billable work running",
    "description": "Users navigate away from expensive invoice previews, but worker capacity remains occupied until the full calculation finishes.\n\nTribal constraint: Jobs intentionally outlive HTTP request contexts; the supported cancellation path is Runner.Cancel(jobID), and preview jobs must retain their stable job ID across retries.",
